    "Combined group budgets and replacement overlap are conservative. A free-memory snapshot does not protect against another process allocating later.",
    "Private request quotas exclude public session arenas, which are charged separately in aggregate admission.",
    "The legacy dense library pool remains available through its original KV-only API; the common aggregate contract applies to the qualified GGUF CLI path.",
    "Static queued cohorts do not establish external-arrival/cancellation serving, sustained throughput/TTFT/ITL tails, diverse cold/warm offload efficiency or vLLM parity.",
    "CPU AVX2/AVX512/NEON and Metal qualification remains required.",
    "Native DeepSeek now shares the common managed-payload ledger through its own exact-shape CLI pool; native_followup_evidence records this follow-up. Setup/physical peaks and external arrival/performance qualification remain pending."
  ],
